text_01F8:
    string "I like clean water, mo"       ; ja: キレイな水が好きだも

text_020D:
    string "If I'm doing it, I'll go all out,%Kmo"  ; ja: やるからには全力で行くも

text_0226:
    string "%NMY will do its best, mo"    ; ja: %NMYはがんばるも

text_0237:
    string "Soon I can go back to the lake,%Kmo ★"  ; ja: もうすぐ湖にかえれるも★

text_0250:
    string "Is it okay if I just win like%Kthis, mo?"  ; ja: このまま勝っちゃっていいかも？

text_026F:
    string "Easy-peasy, mo ♪"             ; ja: らっくしょ～だも♪

text_0282:
    string "The flow of the water changed,%Kmo ♭"  ; ja: 水の流れが変わったも♭

text_0299:
    string "Lucky, mo"                    ; ja: ラッキーだも

text_02A6:
    string "Being number 1 is fun, mo ★"  ; ja: １番って楽しいんだも★

text_02BD:
    string "Roll roll roll.... ≦"         ; ja: コロコロコロ・・・・≦

text_02D4:
    string "I rolled down, mo"            ; ja: 転げ落ちゃったも

text_02E5:
    string "Something unbelievable happened,%Kmo ∵"  ; ja: 信じられないことが起こったも∵

text_0304:
    string "If I stop I'll be sent back, mo ∵"  ; ja: 止まったら強制送還だも∵

text_031D:
    string "Maybe I can't avoid it?"      ; ja: よけてけないかも？

text_0330:
    string "No way out!! Maybe...?"       ; ja: 絶体絶命！！かも・・・？

text_0349:
    string "Big stores are hard to avoid,%Kmo ≦"  ; ja: おっきなお店は避けにくいも≦

text_0366:
    string "%NMY can't stop suddenly,%Kmo!"  ; ja: %NMYは急には止まらないも！

text_0381:
    string "What happens if I stop, mo?"  ; ja: 止まったらどうなるも？

text_0398:
    string "Happiness, mo"                ; ja: しあわせも

text_03A3:
    string "I'm happy, mo ♪"              ; ja: うれしいも♪

text_03B0:
    string "I want to stop at a store, mo ★"  ; ja: お店に止まりたいも★

text_03C5:
    string "My store will be taken, mo...."  ; ja: お店が取られちゃうも・・・・

text_03E2:
    string "It needs restocking, mo ∈"    ; ja: 補充の必要があるも∈

text_03F7:
    string "It's gone empty, mo"          ; ja: カラッポになっちゃったも

text_0410:
    string "A happy payday, mo"           ; ja: うれしい給料日だも

text_0423:
    string "Maybe I'll buy mineral water, mo"  ; ja: ミネラルウォーターでも買っちゃうも

text_0446:
    string "I get money, mo ♪"            ; ja: お金がもらえるも♪

text_0459:
    string "On the way up, mo"            ; ja: 上り調子だも

text_0466:
    string "The water's getting clean, mo"  ; ja: 水がキレイになってきたも

text_047F:
    string "Nice weather, mooo...."       ; ja: いー天気だもぉ・・・・

text_0496:
    string "%NMY rolls easily, mo.."      ; ja: %NMYはころがりやすいも・・

text_04B1:
    string "My rank went down, mo!"       ; ja: 順位が下がったも！

text_04C4:
    string "I want someone to splash water on%Kme, mo..."  ; ja: 水かけて欲しいも・・・

text_04DB:
    string "It's nothing, mo"             ; ja: なんでもないも

text_04EA:
    string "Bubble bubble bubble bubble...."  ; ja: ぶくぶくぶくぶく・・・・

text_0503:
    string "Dodging it would be a bonus, mo"  ; ja: 避けて行けたらボーナスものだも

text_0522:
    string "I'll buy a store and become its%Kmanager, mo ★"  ; ja: 店を買って店長になるも★

text_053B:
    string "Heading there in a hurry, mo!"  ; ja: 急いで向かうも！

text_054C:
    string "I want a store with a pool, mo ♪"  ; ja: プール付きの店が欲しいも♪

text_0567:
    string "Maybe I shouldn't go to the store?"  ; ja: お店に行ったらダメかも？

text_0580:
    string "Maybe I'll learn a little from%Kit...."  ; ja: 少し見習うかも・・・・

text_0597:
    string "If I stop at the store it's a%Kpinch, mo ∵"  ; ja: 店に止まったらぴんちだも∵

text_05B2:
    string "I'll stop by the bank, mo ★"  ; ja: 銀行に寄ってくだも★

text_05C7:
    string "I'll try to stop by the bank,%Kmo ♪"  ; ja: 銀行によってけるようガンバルも♪

text_05E8:
    string "I want money, mooo!"          ; ja: お金が欲しいもぉぉぉ！

text_05FF:
    string "I'll get away from here fast, mo"  ; ja: ここから早く逃げ出すも

text_0616:
    string "Hey, where are %NMY's%Kstores?"  ; ja: ねえ、%NMYのお店は？

text_062B:
    string "If I'm running away, it's now or%Knever, mo..."  ; ja: 逃げ出すなら今のうちだも・・・

text_064A:
    string "Hmm, what should I restock... mo?"  ; ja: う～ん、何を仕入れるか・・・も？

text_066B:
    string "I'll stock goldfish food, mo ♪"  ; ja: 金魚のエサを仕入れるも♪

text_0684:
    string "Restocking is fun, mo"        ; ja: 仕入れっておもしろいも

text_069B:
    string "Have I been over there, mo?"  ; ja: あっちには行ったことがあるも？

text_06BA:
    string "I'll head over there, mo"     ; ja: あっちに向かってくだも

text_06D1:
    string "I'll decide by the stick-falling%Kgame, mo"  ; ja: どっちか棒倒しで決めるも

text_06EA:
    string "I'll go to the elevator, mo..."  ; ja: エレベーターに行くも・・・

text_0705:
    string "Um... I'll ride the elevator,%Kmo ★"  ; ja: えっと・・・エレベーター乗るも★

text_0726:
    string "What shall I do today, mo?"   ; ja: 今日は何をするかも？

text_073B:
    string "Puku puku (bubbles)"          ; ja: ぷくぷく

text_0744:
    string "Mo? Momomo?"                  ; ja: も？ももも？

text_0751:
    string "Don't untie me, mo!"          ; ja: ほどいちゃ、いやだも！
